  "description": "After drinking a single bottle of wine while intoxicated, Hyun-Jun finds himself entangled with Ki-Yeon, a vampire. Until he can break the contract, he is forced into an awkward living arrangement with Ki-Yeon… What will become of this story—of Ki-Yeon, the vampire searching for a true partner, and Hyun-Jun, the human who has become hopelessly ensnared in Ki-Yeon’s trap?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Lucent's Cheunggan X-eum Danpyeonseon (층간X음 단편선) Collection.*",
